<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Thank you for your time today, it was a pleasure speaking with you.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="arial">As we discussed, your business is still eligible for our Renewal Program when the need does arise in your business.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="arial">Please save this email with my contact information and feel free to contact me with any questions regarding your account.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;">Thank you,<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font size="4"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">{!User.Name}</span></font><br><br><font size="4" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-style: italic;"></span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"></span>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CoolProspect">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br>P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}<br>Email: {!User.Email}<br></p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
